d if do i = 1 , size ( targets ) if (. not . is_program_in_scope ( targets ( i ), scope )) cycle outbase_full = basename ( targets ( i )% ptr % output_file ) outbase_stem = basename ( targets ( i )% ptr % output_file , suffix = . false .) do j = 1 , size ( names ) if ( len_trim ( names ( j )) == 0 ) cycle if ( glob ( outbase_full , trim ( names ( j ))) . or . glob ( outbase_stem , trim ( names ( j )))) then keep ( i ) = . true . exit end if end do end do end subroutine select_names_or_all","tags":"","url":"proc/select_names_or_all.html"},{"title":"build_child_command – fpm-watch","text":"private  function build_child_command(exe0, log_format, restart_count) result(cmd) Serialize child argv with a generation counter and the parent's log format. Remove supervisor flags and prior log-format/child markers from the leading\nwatcher options. Preserve other leading values and every forwarded token\nafter the subcommand, quoting each original argv token independently. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name character(len=*), intent(in) :: exe0 character(len=*), intent(in) :: log_format integer, intent(in) :: restart_count Return Value character(len=:), allocatable Calls proc~~build_child_command~~CallsGraph proc~build_child_command build_child_command proc~choose_self_exe choose_self_exe proc~build_child_command->proc~choose_self_exe proc~get_arg get_arg proc~build_child_command->proc~get_arg proc~quote_arg quote_arg proc~build_child_command->proc~quote_arg proc~starts_with starts_with proc~build_child_command->proc~starts_with proc~watch_option_takes_value watch_option_takes_value proc~build_child_command->proc~watch_option_takes_value str str proc~build_child_command->str proc~choose_self_exe->proc~get_arg proc~is_windows is_windows proc~quote_arg->proc~is_windows get_os_type get_os_type proc~is_windows->get_os_type Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Pro