( error )) then call log_event ( \"error\" , \"supervisor.workspace_failed\" , error % message ) stop 127 end if end subroutine execute_supervised_child","tags":"","url":"proc/execute_supervised_child.html"},{"title":"supervisor_loop – fpm-watch","text":"private  subroutine supervisor_loop(delay0, max0, exe0, log_format) Launch watcher children until success, user interruption, or restart exhaustion. max0 counts restarts after the initial launch; nonpositive values are\nunlimited. Clamp delay0 to zero or greater. Each restart increments the\nchild generation. A user interruption or exhausted limit exits with the\nchild execution status; a zero child status exits successfully.\nStatus propagation is quiet so runtime diagnostics cannot fail on a\ndisconnected terminal and replace the child's exit status. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name real, intent(in) :: delay0 integer, intent(in) :: max0 character(len=*), intent(in) :: exe0 character(len=*), intent(in) :: log_format Calls proc~~supervisor_loop~~CallsGraph proc~supervisor_loop supervisor_loop interface~log_int log_int proc~supervisor_loop->interface~log_int proc~build_child_command build_child_command proc~supervisor_loop->proc~build_child_command proc~execute_supervised_child execute_supervised_child proc~supervisor_loop->proc~execute_supervised_child proc~ftoa ftoa proc~supervisor_loop->proc~ftoa proc~log_event log_event proc~supervisor_loop->proc~log_event proc~log_real log_real proc~supervisor_loop->proc~log_real proc~log_string log_string proc~supervisor_loop->proc~log_string proc~sleep_seconds sleep_seconds proc~supervisor_loop->proc~sleep_seconds str str proc~supervisor_loop->str proc~log_default_int log_default_int interface~log_int->proc~log_default_int proc~log_int64 log_int64 interface~log_int->proc~log_int64 proc~build_child_command->str proc~choose_self_exe choose_self_exe proc~build_child_command->proc~choose_self_exe proc~get_arg get_arg proc~build_child_command->proc~get_arg proc~quote_